    intro: "Songs, films and slogans speak about love constantly, yet the word is often thin. We say we love pizza and we love our children with the same word. John gives love a definition that does not start with us: in this is love, not that we loved God but that he loved us and sent his Son to be the propitiation for our sins. Real love is seen at the cross.",
