    intro: "A child's first question about God is often, 'Is God good?' It is also an adult's hardest question in suffering. The Bible answers firmly. God is the source of all that is good, and his goodness is shown in sunrise and harvest, in family and friendship, and most of all in salvation. Even when we cannot trace his hand, we can trust his heart.",
