    prayer: "Thank the faithful God whose mercies are new every morning. Confess our faithlessness. Ask for patience to wait on his promises.",
    teacher: "Learners may be in a season of waiting or grief. Do not rush them to feel hopeful. Allow lament, then point to God's character. Share your own example of God's faithfulness carefully.",
